## https://github.com/libvips/vipsdisp#shortcuts
Scroll around                             | Up/Dn/Lt/Rt
Move by a screen size                     | S-Up/Dn/Lt/Rt
Move to image edges                       | C-Up/Dn/Lt/Rt
Pick a particular zoom out                | C-$
Best fit                                  | 0
Toggle debug rendering mode               | d
Zoom in/out                               | i/o / +/-
Prev/Next page                            | C-</>
Prev/Next image                           | A-Lt/Rt
Zoom                                      | MW
Pan                                       | MW-S/C- / L_drag
Replace image                             | C-d
Save image                                | C-s
New viewer                                | C-n
Duplicate view                            | C-d
Toggle properties                         | A-Etr
Vipsdisp: Copy paste of filenames         | C-c
Vipsdisp: Lists of filenames and textures | C-v
Vipsdisp: Fullscreen                      | F11